<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ expenditure-based GDP rises 0.6 pct in Dec qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ expenditure-based GDP rises 0.6 pct in Dec qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released estimates of expenditure on real gross domestic product for the quarter ended December 31, 1996 (revised from figures in brackets).</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted percentage change from previous qtr at constant 1991/92 prices:</p>
<p>    Dec 1996	    Sept 1996	     Dec 1995</p>
<p>    0.6 pct	     0.8 pct (0.9 pct)   1.0 pct (0.8)</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted percentage change from same qtr previous year at constant 1991/92 prices:</p>
<p>    Dec 1996	    Sept 1996	     Dec 1995</p>
<p>    2.1 pct	     2.6 pct (2.1 pct)   1.8 pct (1.6)</p>
<p>Actual annual percentage change</p>
<p>    Dec 1996	    Sept 1996	     Dec 1995</p>
<p>    2.1 pct	     2.0 pct (1.8 pct)   2.7 pct (2.7)</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
